CONSEQUENCE: the gm transition-to-COMPLETE four-observation gate (worktree-clean + remote-pushed + prd-empty + mutables-witnessed, all simultaneous) CANNOT be satisfied by either agent alone — the other's uncommitted files keep the worktree dirty and the other's pending PRD rows keep prd-empty=false. Forcing COMPLETE would close the peer's live work; resolving the peer's rows would fabricate witnesses.

